I have a DS20L (CS20 made by Compaq/HP) and I've successfully
installed lm_sensors.

I have the following kernel modules loaded:
i2c_ali15x3
hwmon
hwmon_vid
adm9240

I also have i2c and all i2c-algos built as modules, but they don't
appear to be loaded.

This is all with lm_sensors-2.10.4. Gnome's sensor-applet even works. :)

Hope this is useful.

Matt Turner
